{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"c3964c1178367e533d27ccd00c187542305c1802a6fa889d93dce06a6f17d6cc"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:e748bdc12163a2c3931ec4b7c5f63326d1804866c7e4f8da139631c827a1765a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"One of the states with a Universal Studios park","evidence":"[D10:9 | 2:52 pm on 31 August, 2023] Tim: Thanks! Excited to try this. Love experimenting with spices. By the way, have you been to Universal Studios? Planning a trip there next month.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9dd9526e-740f-56b6-bb28-11ceb57579cd","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8df407b1ab292f8b4f09b8af0570374bdcafbc8cf215c917f26c9ff28a8f6bd7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which US states might Tim be in during September 2023 based on his plans of visiting Universal Studios?","referenceAnswer":"California or Florida","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8df407b1ab292f8b4f09b8af0570374bdcafbc8cf215c917f26c9ff28a8f6bd7"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}